  "sourceTitle": "Lemongrass Sweet Chili Dippin Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Lemongrass Sweet Chili Dippin Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 11:28pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n8 large chilies, chopped\n1 cup vinegar\n1 cup water\n2 cups sugar\n4 stalks Lemongrass, chopped\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Remove the seeds from the chilies, then chop. 2 Place in a saucepan with remaining ingredients. 3 Simmer over medium heat until the sauce thickens slightly (about 25 minutes).",
